  RESOLVES IS A FLOOR AND NOT A VERDICT. It reads the line NUMBER, never the line: a citation can point inside a file and at completely different code than the document claims. For the semantic question on a given app use tools/citation_line_drift_check.py --app X --prefix Y.
  every qualified citation points inside its file, and that is ALL exit 0 means here. The 323 bare `:NNNN` citation(s) are unmeasured by this mode. AT-RISK still need re-checking against their moved targets.
